@SeasonId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Season with its league, previous and next season, and phases with rounds (take the id from GET /seasons)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}
Accept: application/json

### Error: the season does not exist (404)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Error: the id is not a GUID (404, the route does not match)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/not-a-guid
Accept: application/json
